        "heading": "Common Symptoms of Iron Deficiency Anemia",
        "content": "Iron deficiency anemia can take time to occur. However, as iron decreases in the body, a person might experience feelings of fatigue and weakness and find it hard to perform their everyday tasks.",
        "items": [],
        "columns": [],
