        "id": "block-7",
        "type": "clinical_overview",
        "heading": "Mental health belongs in the conversation",
        "content": "A health check shouldn't only be about blood tests and physical symptoms. Stress, anxiety, depression, poor sleep and burnout can affect everyday life just as much as a physical health problem. If you've been feeling low for weeks, constantly anxious, or finding it difficult to function, bring it up with a healthcare professional."
